{"game":"Keep Talking and Nobody Explodes","source":"custom","apworld":"ktane.apworld","world_version":"0.3.0","groups":[{"name":"Game Options","collapsed":false,"options":[{"key":"progression_balancing","name":"Progression Balancing","kind":"named_range","doc":"A system that can move progression earlier, to try and prevent the player from getting stuck and bored early.\n\nA lower setting means more getting stuck. A higher setting means less getting stuck.","weighted":true,"visibility":15,"doc_html":"<p>A system that can move progression earlier, to try and prevent the player from getting stuck and bored early.</p>\n<p>A lower setting means more getting stuck. A higher setting means less getting stuck.</p>\n","min":0,"max":99,"default":50,"special":{"disabled":0,"normal":50,"extreme":99},"doc_fr":"Un système qui peut déplacer la progression plus tôt, pour essayer et empêcher le joueur de se coincer et s'ennuyer tôt.\n\nUn réglage plus bas signifie qu'il reste coincé. Un réglage plus élevé signifie moins se coincer.","doc_html_fr":"<p>Un système qui peut déplacer la progression plus tôt, pour essayer et empêcher le joueur de se coincer et s'ennuyer tôt.</p>\n<p>Un réglage plus bas signifie qu'il reste coincé. Un réglage plus élevé signifie moins se coincer.</p>\n"},{"key":"accessibility","name":"Accessibility","kind":"choice","doc":"Set rules for reachability of your items/locations.\n\n**Full:** ensure everything can be reached and acquired.\n\n**Minimal:** ensure what is needed to reach your goal can be acquired.","weighted":true,"visibility":15,"doc_html":"<p>Set rules for reachability of your items/locations.</p>\n<p><strong>Full:</strong> ensure everything can be reached and acquired.</p>\n<p><strong>Minimal:</strong> ensure what is needed to reach your goal can be acquired.</p>\n","choices":[{"value":"full","label":"Full","id":0},{"value":"minimal","label":"Minimal","id":2}],"aliases":{"items":"full","locations":"full","none":"minimal"},"default":"full","doc_fr":"Définir les règles d'accessibilité de vos objets/emplacements.\n\n**Full:** s'assurer que tout peut être atteint et acquis.\n\n**Minimal:** s'assurer que ce qui est nécessaire pour atteindre votre objectif peut être acquis.","doc_html_fr":"<p>Définir les règles d'accessibilité de vos objets/emplacements.</p>\n<p><strong>Full:</strong> s'assurer que tout peut être atteint et acquis.</p>\n<p><strong>Minimal:</strong> s'assurer que ce qui est nécessaire pour atteindre votre objectif peut être acquis.</p>\n"},{"key":"random_rule_seed","name":"Use Random Rule Seed","kind":"toggle","doc":"Use random puzzle solutions for the modules.","weighted":true,"visibility":15,"default":"true"},{"key":"rule_seed","name":"Rule Seed Number","kind":"range","doc":"If \"Use Random Rule Seed\" is set to false, define the custom rule seed used to solve the modules.\nSet to 1 to use vanilla rules.","weighted":true,"visibility":15,"min":1,"max":10000,"default":1,"doc_fr":"Si \"Utiliser Random Rule Seed\" est défini à false, définissez la règle de base utilisée pour résoudre les modules.\nRéglez à 1 pour utiliser les règles de vanille."},{"key":"adventure_mode","name":"Adventure Mode","kind":"choice","doc":"Choose which adventure/playthrough to use.\nVanilla Vanguard = Only vanilla modules that are already in the game\nPraetorian Pact = Includes modules that are ruleseedable in the first 150 modded modules released.","weighted":true,"visibility":15,"choices":[{"value":"vanilla_vanguard","label":"Vanilla Vanguard","id":0},{"value":"praetorian_pact","label":"Praetorian Pact","id":1}],"aliases":{},"default":"vanilla_vanguard","doc_fr":"Choisissez l'aventure/le jeu à utiliser.\nVanilla Vanguard = Seuls les modules de vanille qui sont déjà dans le jeu Praetorian Pact = Inclut les modules qui sont régulables dans les 150 premiers modules enrobés libérés."},{"key":"hardlock_modules","name":"Hardlock Modules","kind":"toggle","doc":"Bombs that can't be finished will not be accessible. Only when all the modules that can be on a bomb are unlocked\nthat the bomb is unlocked. Strongly recommended if \"Use Random Rule Seed\" is disabled.","weighted":true,"visibility":15,"default":"false","doc_fr":"Les bombes qui ne peuvent pas être finies ne seront pas accessibles. Seulement quand tous les modules qui peuvent être sur une bombe sont déverrouillés que la bombe est déverrouillée. Fortement recommandé si \"Utiliser la semence de règle aléatoire\" est désactivé."},{"key":"ohko_mode","name":"OHKO Mode","kind":"toggle","doc":"One mistake and it's over. Only activate if you are hardcore.","weighted":true,"visibility":15,"default":"false","doc_fr":"Une erreur et c'est fini. Activez seulement si vous êtes hardcore."},{"key":"death_link","name":"Death Link","kind":"toggle","doc":"When you die, everyone who enabled death link dies. Of course, the reverse is true too.","weighted":true,"visibility":15,"doc_html":"<p>When you die, everyone who enabled death link dies. Of course, the reverse is true too.</p>\n","default":"false","doc_fr":"Quand vous mourez, tous ceux qui ont permis la mort meurent. Bien sûr, l'inverse est vrai aussi.","doc_html_fr":"<p>Quand vous mourez, tous ceux qui ont permis la mort meurent. Bien sûr, l'inverse est vrai aussi.</p>\n"},{"key":"death_link_behaviour","name":"Death Link Behaviour","kind":"choice","doc":"Manages how Death Links are sent and received.","weighted":true,"visibility":15,"choices":[{"value":"explosion","label":"Explosion","id":0},{"value":"strike","label":"Strike","id":1}],"aliases":{},"default":"explosion","doc_fr":"Gère comment les Liens de la Mort sont envoyés et reçus."}]},{"name":"Item & Location Options","collapsed":true,"options":[{"key":"local_items","name":"Local Items","kind":"set","doc":"Forces these items to be in their native world.","weighted":false,"visibility":15,"doc_html":"<p>Forces these items to be in their native world.</p>\n","default":[],"valid_keys":[],"key_source":"items","name_groups":true,"doc_fr":"Force ces 